cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Global Video Platforms Registry 2026 (verified, 1071 records)"
authors:
  - alias: rtynbirf
    name-suffix: "and contributors"
version: 3.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-25"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rtynbirf/global-video-platforms-registry"
url: "https://github.com/rtynbirf/global-video-platforms-registry"
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable registry of 1071 video platforms worldwide with per-domain
  HTTP verification (two full passes: 2026-10-24 and 2026-10-25), documented
  verdict scheme (ALIVE/BLOCKED/PARKED/MOVED), rebrand and closure tracking
  (21 merged rows with successors), and an explicit content policy that
  excludes piracy, political propaganda and adult platforms.
  Delivered as CSV/JSON/XLSX plus a verification report.
keywords:
  - video platforms
  - streaming
  - OTT
  - registry
  - dataset
  - media research
